 FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">수강인원 초과 강좌</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #00cc33; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">&nbsp; 수강신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\"><img height=\"8\" alt=\"\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000658bf06.gif\" width=\"570\" border=\"0\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;수강인원이 초과한 강좌에 대하여 수강제한인원이 증원 조정됨을 알리오니&nbsp; 아래 수강신청 시점부터 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;계절수업은 폐강과목외에 수강변경이 되지 않습니다&nbsp;<br><br><br></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; ○ 수강신청 시점 : 2011. 6. 2(목)&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\">10 : 00부터</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font size=\"4\"><br><br>○ 계절수업 수강신청제한인원 증원 과목&nbsp;</font></strong><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;</font></span><font size=\"4\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"><br></span></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▶</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"> 증원내역&nbsp; :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">수강인원이 초과된 강좌에 대하여 10명증원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.1pt\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 단, 수강인원 미달분반이 있는 과목은 제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><strong><font face=\"한컴돋움\" size=\"3\"></font></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff6699; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\">전공컴퓨터기초 과목 분반 증설 취소 되었습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.1pt\">&nbsp;꼭, 이수하여야 졸업이 가능한 4학년 학생은</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;담당 교수님과 상담하시기 바랍니다. D447호</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;♤ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\">기타 문의</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.3pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\">☎ 478 - 7030</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.3pt\"> 교무연구처(본관 201호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
